{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Invoke `load` with the producer's payload context.** For framed inputs and chained-invoke results, this passes the consumer's ARN/entity/kind to custom offloaders. Context-keyed or context-authorized offloaders therefore cannot load cross-execution values; the filesystem implementation only works because it reads owner fields directly. Persist/reconstruct the full producer context and test a context-keyed offloader through chained invoke.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odJbr","finding_digest":"e0beaef538b3e0f8a8da905e6e36136b6277b1c0142756bd528e4b3b4b0364d3","finding_id":"arf_v1_4c7k55jywpqprkg2sbpg4nqtnn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::resolve::producer-context-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::resolve::producer-context-preservation","line":160,"observation_digest":"94623439752e06276199f81a7e90a2d2a6246b6dc7fd43448c2a7db670ab69c8","observation_id":"aro_v1_srrdiolvfydcoymz7anh5efc2k","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_4c7k55jywpqprkg2sbpg4nqtnn","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:52Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vlvjn3k2bg6cxoepbwrwc2slgw","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"88bc34d2d082149d899d22adc7327b4f4d12ef4c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":160,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_zyhixwsgsmyvlpnp2jldi2zpfe","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:52Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
